    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ on Dena lage hé ah fihtwite ⁊ fyrdwita, griðbryce ⁊ hamsocne, butan he hwǽne furðor gemæðrian wylle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in the Danelaw he has the receipt of fines for fighting, neglect of military service, breach of the peace and attacks upon people's houses, unless he desires specially to honour anyone [by granting him these dues].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And on Dæna lage he ah fihtewite ⁊ fyrdwita, gryðbryce ⁊ hamsocne, butan he hwæne ðe furður gemæðrian wylle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
